OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShetland
OL,6,Fstaying dry this evening. Some patchy
OL,7,Frain will develop across Orkney, this
OL,8,Fturning heavier towards midnight and
OL,9,Fextending to Shetland overnight.
OL,10,FStrengthening south or southeast wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA wet start to the day with
OL,13,Fsome heavy rain, soon brightening up
OL,14,Fto sunshine and scattered showers over
OL,15,FOrkney, then Shetland brightening in
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
