OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday will be a very showery day,
OL,7,Fwhile Orkney will be windy too. Sunny
OL,8,Fintervals and some lighter showers on
OL,9,FSunday. Bright start Monday, cloudy
OL,10,Fwith a little rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
